WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.060
From our platform perspective,

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:05.400
other partners that may or may not compete with IBM

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.540
will have the same platform available for them to build their solutions on top of.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.700
I mean, we have to maintain the trust in our partners,

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:20.310
and so I think that's really important
to be able to keep going where we're going

